      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: Sorry for long silence. I'm launching a second vrchat with second account using quick launcher. I use \"Join\" option, where it asks Instance link I tried:\n\n- full URL [https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_885e911b-a4bf-40d7-abcc-050f4c102b0c&instanceId=48124~private(usr_73c1d134-862e-4383-b61c-e55cde933066)~canRequestInvite~region(eu)~nonce(80BBE75C23451700F27E3A76655181A122DEAC7B88DE76DA)&shortName=q8dk8tt2]\n\n- short unlocked link [https://vrch.at/q8dk8tt2]\n\n- location id [wrld_885e911b-a4bf-40d7-abcc-050f4c102b0c:48124~private(usr_73c1d134-862e-4383-b61c-e55cde933066)~canRequestInvite~region(eu)~nonce(80BBE75C23451700F27E3A76655181A122DEAC7B88DE76DA)]\n\nEverytime it just sends me to the home world without any error.\n\nLinks to public instances also don't work.\n\nI remember it still worked before like this winter/spring.\n\nIn the logs i found interesting that line:\n\n\"-  Arg: wrld_885e911b-a4bf-40d7-abcc-050f4c102b0c:48124~private(usr_73c1d134-862e-4383-b61c-e55cde933066)~canRequestInvite~region(eu)~nonce(80BBE75C23451700F27E3A76655181A122DEAC7B88DE76DA)\"\n\nor \"- Arg: https://vrch.at/q8dk8tt2\"\n\nI guess there's something wrong with how Quick launcher passes instance launch args/options? \n\nAlso the \"Create\" option doesn't seem to work either.",
