  "details": "Using a steam launch parameter to boot up in a specific instance sometimes works and sends you to the intended instance or fails and send you to your set homeworld, the current live build [1305] never fails with the launch parameter, it only ever sometimes fail on the open betas (tested on [1306] to [1308]).\n\nHere is the parameter me and my friends have been using:\n\nvrchat://launch?ref=vrchat.com&id=wrld_66ab34f1-f906-4cb2-8e9c-9ae6bc0f334a:17511~private(usr_0ae413af-296b-42f7-93fa-594a2de6f46c)~canRequestInvite~region(use)~nonce(75610d2b-1442-42ca-b553-219284635837)&shortName=5n7axtj3\n\nWe've been trying to recreate the issue and have no strong leads, except it seems someone has to attempt to join the instance if it's been inactive for several hours/day, the first person will fail to join but the second will succeed. Though even that is inconsistent and has failed once.",
